        <p>
          Permission is granted to freely use our online protractor tools, angle calculators, and inclinometers for personal, educational, and commercial purposes directly through a standard web browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may not reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, or exploit the proprietary code, design assets, or software architecture of this website without prior express written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The tools and information on AI Online Protractor are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. While we strive for absolute trigonometric precision, physical screen calibrations and touch digitizers vary. Measurements should be independently verified for critical structural engineering or safety-critical construction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall AI Online Protractor or its operators be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the services provided.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with standard applicable internet regulations without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
